<title>USA: Nathan's Famous Inc Q4 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Nathan's Famous Inc Q4 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBURY, N.Y. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiscal Year Ended</p>
<p>					Mar 30, 1997	 Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p>				   (Fifty-two wks)  (Fifty-three wks)</p>
<p> Total revenues		    $26,575,000	  $26,441,000</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)		   788,000	  (6,379,000)</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss) per share	  0.17		 (1.35)</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>  common shares outstanding	4,729,000	    4,722,000</p>
<p>						   Fourth Quarter Ended</p>
<p>					Mar 30, 1997	 Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (Thirteen Wks)     (Fourteen Wks)</p>
<p> Total revenues			5,642,000	    5,748,000</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss)		 (273,000)	  (6,853,000)</p>
<p> Net earnings (loss) per share	(0.06)		 (1.45)</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>  common shares outstanding	4,749,000	    4,722,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for the fourth quarter and fiscal 1996 included approximately $5.8 million of adjustments primarily relating to the impairment of long-lived assets of $3.9 million pursuant to FASB 121, $1.2 million of nonrecurring charges and $700,000 associated with the closing of three stores.</p>
</text>
